/* SKF_TWOKEYSOFF 0x00000100 | entity-page; 2 statement(s), e.g. corpus/win32/api/winuser/ns-winuser-stickykeys.md | also in: Windows.h | value printed only by the Win32 shared reference (a CE page documents the name; verify the number against the CE SDK) */
