/* SM_CXDOUBLECLK 36 | entity-page; 2 statement(s), e.g. corpus/win32/api/winuser/nf-winuser-getsystemmetrics.md | also in: Rapi.h | value printed only by the Win32 shared reference (a CE page documents the name; verify the number against the CE SDK) */
/* quoted (cell): <tr> <td width="40%"><a id="SM_CXDOUBLECLK"></a><a id="sm_cxdoubleclk"></a><dl> <dt><b>SM_CXDOUBLECLK</b></dt> <dt>36</dt> </dl> </td> <td width="60%"> The width of the rectangle around the location of a first click in a double-click sequence, in pixels. The second click must occur within the rectangle that is defined by SM_CXDOUBLECLK and SM_CYDOUBLECLK for the system to consider the two clicks a double-click. The two clicks must also occur within a specified time. To set the width of the double-click rectangle, call <a href="/windows/desktop/api/winuser/nf-winuser-systemparametersinfoa">SystemParametersInfo</a> with SPI_SETDOUBLECLKWIDTH. </td> </tr> */
#define SM_CXDOUBLECLK 36

